  "summary": "Malicious code in @andrewstory18/is-real-odd (npm)",
  "details": "@andrewstory18/is-real-odd is a scoped combosquat of the legitimate is-odd package. Its package.json declares a postinstall lifecycle hook that runs `node index.min.js`, executing a minified JavaScript payload on install. The referenced index.min.js payload file is absent from the published tarball in this version, so the payload did not ship here, but the install-time hook is present and designed to run a bundled minified script.",
